{"term":{"label":"智","occurrences":3,"variants":[]},"source":{"id":"2B","url":"https://ctext.org/mengzi/gongsun-chou-ii","title":"公孫丑下","description":"孟子曰：「天時不如地利，地利不如人和。三里之城，七里之郭，環而攻之而不勝。夫環而攻之，必有得天時者矣；然而不勝者，是天時不如地利也。城非不高也，池非不深也，兵革非不堅利也，米粟非不多也；委而去之，是地利不如人和也。故曰：域民不以封疆之界，固國不以山谿之險，威天下不以兵革之利。得道者多助，失道者寡助。寡助之至，親戚畔之；"},"network":{"directed":false,"multigraph":false,"graph":{},"nodes":[{"form":"仁","id":"仁"},{"form":"何","id":"何"},{"form":"使","id":"使"},{"form":"公","id":"公"},{"form":"周","id":"周"},{"form":"子","id":"子"},{"form":"孟子","id":"孟子"},{"form":"智","id":"智"},{"form":"王","id":"王"},{"form":"畔","id":"畔"},{"form":"知","id":"知"},{"form":"管叔","id":"管叔"},{"form":"義","id":"義"},{"form":"自","id":"自"},{"form":"言","id":"言"},{"form":"過","id":"過"}],"edges":[{"weight":2.0068708488450007,"source":"公","target":"仁"},{"weight":2.9231615807191558,"source":"公","target":"周"},{"weight":2.9231615807191558,"source":"公","target":"智"},{"weight":1.536867219599265,"source":"公","target":"自"},{"weight":0.9772514316638422,"source":"公","target":"使"},{"weight":1.536867219599265,"source":"公","target":"管叔"},{"weight":0.8437200390393197,"source":"公","target":"何"},{"weight":1.536867219599265,"source":"公","target":"畔"},{"weight":0.8437200390393197,"source":"公","target":"知"},{"weight":1.3137236682850553,"source":"公","target":"過"},{"weight":0.25131442828090617,"source":"使","target":"王"},{"weight":1.3339263756025748,"source":"使","target":"周"},{"weight":1.8935421635379974,"source":"使","target":"管叔"},{"weight":1.6058600910862164,"source":"使","target":"知"},{"weight":1.200394982978052,"source":"使","target":"畔"},{"weight":0.3894647667617233,"source":"使","target":"子"},{"weight":1.7600107709134747,"source":"知","target":"自"},{"weight":1.200394982978052,"source":"知","target":"周"},{"weight":1.7600107709134747,"source":"知","target":"畔"},{"weight":0.8754687373538999,"source":"仁","target":"王"},{"weight":3.616308761279101,"source":"仁","target":"義"},{"weight":1.9115606690406757,"source":"仁","target":"言"},{"weight":1.536867219599